         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Practicing Addition with Chosen Numbers\n\nIn this game, you choose the numbers: type two numbers between 0 and 99999 and click **Start**. The addition is written vertically, column by column, from the units upwards, with as many columns as the numbers need.\n\n- Type the digit that stays in the column in the box on the result row.\n- When the sum reaches ten, type 1 in the carry box above the next order.\n\nThe squares show the digit already in the column and how many squares are still missing to reach ten.",
